      "writtenOn": "2020-01-23T06:29:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right so we found that in many cases it\u0027s not enough to know a boolean state (success vs fail-or-not-done), which is why NM.EvaluationState keeps both a mask of completed probes and a mask of succeeded probes. We had an ill-fated attempt to pass that to CS and intend to revive it when time is less scarse.\n\nMaybe you want to report the probes that were actually performed. A network operator might find there is a very big difference in its operations between private DNS not being performed (e.g. because the user has it off) and private DNS being broken (because the network is broken).",
